+## Approach
+
+- `priceOrder` passes the post-volume subtotal (not the gross total) to `couponDiscount`; the cap still uses the gross total.
+- `Coupons.redeemable` refuses only when the date is after `validUntil`.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+VAT on shipping stays at 22% per the README.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-22-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-22-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md
