+++ b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-22-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+## Why
+
+Two coupon bugs: a percentage coupon is computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume discounts (12 × €5.00 with a 10% coupon gives €48.00 instead of €48.60), and a coupon is refused on its last valid day (AUTUMN on 30 November).
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Percentage and fixed coupons are computed on the subtotal after volume discounts, as the README documents.
+- A coupon is redeemable on its `validUntil` day (both ends included).
+- Not changed: VAT on shipping. The README rule says shipping bears 22% VAT, so the request to remove it conflicts with the documented rules and needs a business decision first.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `coupons`: coupon discount base and validity period.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/pricing.ts` (coupon base), `src/coupons.ts` (expiry check), tests.
