@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts
+A coupon SHALL take its percentage, or its fixed amount up to that subtotal, off the order's subtotal after volume discounts, subject to the 50% overall discount cap.
+
+#### Scenario: Percentage coupon with volume discount
+- **WHEN** an order has 12 units at €5.00 and a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** the goods come to €48.60
+
+### Requirement: Coupon valid through its last day
+A coupon SHALL be redeemable on every day from its first day to its last day, both included.
+
+#### Scenario: Last day
+- **WHEN** a coupon valid until 2026-11-30 is used on 2026-11-30
+- **THEN** it is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Day after
+- **WHEN** it is used on 2026-12-01
+- **THEN** it is refused as expired
